### ==============================================================================
### LOCALHOST TESTING (http://localhost:3000)
### ==============================================================================

### Root API Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Swagger Documentation
GET http://localhost:3000/api-docs/

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION & OAUTH ENDPOINTS (Localhost)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Check Authentication Status (Unauthenticated returns loggedIn: false)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/status

### 2. View Protected Profile (Returns 401 Unauthorized when not logged in)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/profile

### 3. Initiate GitHub Login (Browser redirects to GitHub OAuth)
# Note: In browser, visit http://localhost:3000/login to complete the OAuth flow
GET http://localhost:3000/login

### 4. Logout / Session Termination
GET http://localhost:3000/logout


